#: ../../source/docs/modules/terrain.rst:3 ad0186cd7e8846b68e2f4b2b540cc896
msgid "Terrain Reporting"
msgstr "地形报告"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/terrain.rst:9 c152f8f466384bc0b148e0aa2ef17d47
msgid ""
"The terrain module passes downloads and manages DTEM (Digital Terrain "
"Elevation Model) datasets and adds terrain height functionality to the map "
"module. It also allows the autopilot to download terrain data of the "
"surrounding area so that it has an approximate idea of its height above "
"ground."
msgstr ""
"terrain模块负责下载并管理DTEM（数字地形高程模型）数据集，并为地图模块添加地形高度功能。它还允许飞控下载周边区域的地形数据，以便飞控大致了解其距地高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/terrain.rst:15 1149f8c7b9e6466496cac37c97bfa76a
msgid ""
"By default, it uses the freely available `SRTM dataset "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shuttle_Radar_Topography_Mission>`_. For the "
"purposes of this module, a copy of this dataset is hosted `here "
"<https://terrain.ardupilot.org/SRTM3/>`_ Level 3 resolution (90m) is used."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，该模块使用免费的 `SRTM数据集 "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shuttle_Radar_Topography_Mission>`_。就本模块而言，该数据集的副本托管于"
" `此处 <https://terrain.ardupilot.org/SRTM3/>`_，使用3级分辨率（90米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/terrain.rst:21 dc5d140046d34bcd9968401208341397
msgid ""
"Whilst this module does require an Internet connection to download the "
"nearby SRTM tiles, it will cache them on the local hard drive for offline "
"use."
msgstr "虽然此模块需要互联网连接以下载附近的SRTM切片，但会将其缓存到本地硬盘以供离线使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/terrain.rst:25 f4bbae62ab244b85a1f05d274e19d5bd
msgid ""
"Once loaded with ``module load terrain``, the module will automatically "
"download, cache and send small SRTM tiles to the autopilot's internal memory"
" (the SD card on the autopilot, for example)."
msgstr ""
"通过 ``module load terrain`` 加载后，模块将自动下载、缓存小型SRTM切片，并将其发送至飞控的内部存储（例如飞控上的SD卡）。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/terrain.rst:29 493e9b7a72d74943ad4b57f985c9ddd5
msgid "The status of the module can be shown by entering ``terrain status``."
msgstr "可通过输入 ``terrain status`` 查看模块状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/terrain.rst:31 9455a9f99c504f16a541579386a76d1a
msgid ""
"To get the terrain height at a particular location, use ``terrain check "
"<lat> <lon>``` or right click on the map (module must be loaded to display)"
msgstr "要获取特定位置的地形高度，请使用 ``terrain check <lat> <lon>`` 或在地图上右键单击（需加载模块才能显示）。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/terrain.rst:34 997d6a7305934f948044e02dc5cc55af
msgid ""
"To use higher resolution SRTM data, a Level 1 dataset is `available "
"<https://terrain.ardupilot.org/SRTM1/>`_. Use ``terrain set source SRTM1`` "
"to use. To go back to the Level 3 dataset, use ``terrain set source SRTM3``"
msgstr ""
"若要使用更高分辨率的SRTM数据，1级数据集可 `在此获取 <https://terrain.ardupilot.org/SRTM1/>`_。使用 "
"``terrain set source SRTM1`` 切换。若要返回3级数据集，请使用 ``terrain set source SRTM3``。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/terrain.rst:37 5c076fb2f9744ea98c540f84a33aff9e
msgid ""
"In addition, you can prevent the downloading of tiles from the Internet for "
"testing purposes, using the following command to disable it:"
msgstr "此外，可使用以下命令禁止从互联网下载切片（用于测试目的）："
